    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Curse Legion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as the progenitor of vampires, leading your Blood Curse Legion to sweep across the world, establishing a vampire nation and dominating a region.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game supports up to 4 players, with both cooperative and competitive modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players mainly control the vampire cavalry legion in combat, changing their formation according to different situations to maximize damage output and customize support formations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.poster.avif?t=1751272807\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.webm?t=1751272807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.mp4?t=1751272807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero units: Heroes have random attributes, providing a different game experience each time. They are generally 4 types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skill selection allows you to customize the growth direction of your heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of troops:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spear infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying troops</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own vampire castle: You can construct multi-layered castles and decorate them with loot. Castles cannot be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build front-line fortresses to block enemy attacks. Note that front-line fortresses can be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and Craft system: You can combine weapons and other important items.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Curse Legion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as the progenitor of vampires, leading your Blood Curse Legion to sweep across the world, establishing a vampire nation and dominating a region.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game supports up to 4 players, with both cooperative and competitive modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players mainly control the vampire cavalry legion in combat, changing their formation according to different situations to maximize damage output and customize support formations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.poster.avif?t=1751272807\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.webm?t=1751272807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.mp4?t=1751272807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero units: Heroes have random attributes, providing a different game experience each time. They are generally 4 types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich skill selection allows you to customize the growth direction of your heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of troops:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spear infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying troops</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own vampire castle: You can construct multi-layered castles and decorate them with loot. Castles cannot be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build front-line fortresses to block enemy attacks. Note that front-line fortresses can be destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and Craft system: You can combine weapons and other important items.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a RTS game where you primarily control cavalry units in battle. Utilize the vampire's abilities to command in battle, develop unique vampire heroes based on the game's evolving situation, and form a powerful Blood Curse Legion to dominate the world and establish a vampire nation.",
